WEBVTT

00:00:14.166 --> 00:00:16.041
(Low growling)

00:00:23.958 --> 00:00:26.291
- And this is Euston.
- (Grunts)

00:00:26.416 --> 00:00:27.916
- St Pancras.
- (Grunts)

00:00:28.041 --> 00:00:30.750
- Waterloo, Piccadilly, Baker Street.
- (Grunting)

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:32.875
- High Barnet, Bromley-by-Bow.
- (Grunting)

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.958
- Leicester Square, Elephant and Castle.
- (Grunting)

00:00:36.083 --> 00:00:38.500
- Clapham North, Clapham South.
- (Grunting)

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:42.458
- And Cutty Sark for Maritime Greenwich.
- (Low growl)

00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:44.416
(Gasps) Hey...

00:00:45.666 --> 00:00:47.250
Tell me this...

00:00:47.375 --> 00:00:51.291
Do any of your friends
care for the theatre?

00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:53.916
Perhaps some of them
like to perform?

00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:56.166
As you know,
I am shortly to be released,

00:00:56.291 --> 00:01:00.875
and I wonder...
red cape, flaxen wig, lights.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Phoenix Buchanan is... Goldilocks!

00:01:05.125 --> 00:01:07.791
- (Grunting and growling)
- Yes?

00:01:07.916 --> 00:01:10.583
- (Grunting)
- (Buchanan) Oh, yes, they like it.

00:01:10.708 --> 00:01:13.958
- Who wants to be Daddy Bear? You!
- (Grunting)

00:01:14.083 --> 00:01:16.000
- Mummy Bear, you!
- (Grunting)

00:01:16.125 --> 00:01:18.041
- And Baby Bear, come hither.
- (Squealing)

00:01:18.166 --> 00:01:21.041
Don't be frightened, come here.
Let's talk.

00:01:21.958 --> 00:01:26.125
I am thinking the autumn, I am thinking
a small theatre, the Wyndham, the Duchess.

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:27.750
And I am thinking
we may need some money.

00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:30.958
You who've been to El Dorado.
Did you, by any chance, find any?

00:01:31.083 --> 00:01:34.083
- (Paddington) We found these...
- (All grunting)

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.416
Oranges?

00:01:38.666 --> 00:01:40.250
That is disappointing.

00:07:56.666 --> 00:07:59.083
What fun! What fun.

00:07:59.208 --> 00:08:01.041
What a lovely bunch of...

00:08:01.166 --> 00:08:03.833
...of-of... fur.

